  "description": "Fuaran UI described as a design system: one call renders a preview card per IDL kind (swept over the tone, weight and emphasis axes), per certified stdlib fragment, and for the type, spacing and colour-role scales of a chosen Theme, beside the theme as a DTCG manifest and a content-hashed bundle manifest. Colours are offered as tone ROLES, never as literal values. Apache-2.0 licensed.",
